abstract: >-
  Research-software and artefact archive accompanying the DCM Artefact Governance paper, "An
  Use-Relative Governance of Model-Derived Artefacts Across Modular Modelling Boundaries Under Deep
  Uncertainty", which is in
  preparation. It contains schemas, governed artefacts, hourly
  incremental-electricity traces, future-specific multipliers, validators, fixtures, screening
  calculations and figure scripts. A single command re-executes the documented
  IncrementalElectricityPack and BiomassSupplyPack checks and calculations and regenerates Figure 2
  from the supplied inputs. The archive does not regenerate the upstream model run or the
  future-specific multipliers, and it does not validate the underlying models. Values reproduced
  from EECA (2022) are third-party material, attributed in DATA_SOURCES.md. The manuscript is not
  included.
